# runs/ is intentionally NOT ignored here (unlike the pre-move factory-automation/factory/.gitignore,
# which excluded it by default). Daniel explicitly authorized committing the real run artifacts
# (corpora, manifests, rigor reports, cost packets, eval results) to this single unified location
# on 2026-08-13, after a data-governance check (FORBIDDEN_ORG_PREFIX cross-org guard + PII review —
# see fine-tuning/factory-product/AGENTS.md) found no violation. __pycache__/, *.pyc, .DS_Store are
# already ignored repo-wide by the root .gitignore; .pytest_cache/ and .ruff_cache/ carry their own
# nested "ignore everything" .gitignore files that moved with this directory.
